[Text Area]
Section=0
Page=2
Text=* Schematic File
Text=*
Text=* Syntax:
Text=* .MODEL <model name> [AKO:<reference model name>] <ModelType>
Text=* +([<parameter name>=<value>][LOT[/#][/GAUSS|/UNIFORM|/WCASE]=[<tol>[%]] |[-<low>%,<high>%]][DEV[/#][/GAUSS|/UNIFORM|/WCASE]=[<tol>[%]]...)
Text=* ModelType must be one of OPA,D,NPN,NMOS,NJF,PUL,SIN,TRN,CORE,GASFET,VSWITCH,ISWITCH,CAP,IND,RES,PNP,PMOS,PJF,DOUTPUT,DINPUT,UADC,UDAC,UGATE,UTGATE,UEFF,UGFF,UDLY,UPLD,UROM,URAM,UBGT,UIO,LPNP,NIGBT,I,V
Text=*
Text=*Examples:
Text=* .MODEL 2N2222A NPN(BF=150 IS=1E-14)
Text=* .model M1 NMOS(KP=2.5E-5 VTO=1.345 CGDO=14.67p CGBO=4.566p)
Text=* .MODEL DK D(IS=1E-18)
Text=* .model 2N2222A AKO:2N2222 NPN (BF=55 ISE=10F)
Text=* .Model BJT1 NPN (RE=12 LOT/1/GAUSS=30% DEV/2/UNIFORM=2%)
Text=*
Text=* A .cir file is typically found in the data directory
Text=*
Text=.SUBCKT  400kV_Donaumast_transposed_Z0Z1Z0m  1a 2a 3a 4a 5a 6a 1b 2b 3b 4b 5b 6b
Text=+ PARAMS:
Text=****************************************
Text=* Only few parameters for the symmetric case (fully transposed lines)
Text=+ R0=0.22952 R1=0.01472 R0m=0.0358
Text=+ L0=0.00462 L1=8.577e-4 L0m=1.6783e-3 L1m=0
Text=+ C0=4.577e-9 C1=1.387e-8 C0m=2.28921e-9 C1m=0
Text=*+ L0=0.00462 L1=8.3e-4 L0m=1.6783e-3 L1m=0 no coupling
Text=*+ C0=4.577e-9 C1=1.387e-8 C0m=2.28921e-9 C1m=0 no couling
Text=* see also Donaumast_2sys_400kV_transposed2.wxmx
Text=* and ATP_Donaumasst_2sys_400kV_2x3x635_117_1x234_47_transposed2.xlsx.param
Text=+ L0s={L0-L0m} L1s={L1-L1m}
Text=+ Lm1={(L0s-L1s)/3} Lm2={(L0m-L1m)/3} Lm3={Lm2+L1m} Ls={L1s+Lm1}
Text=+ C0s={C0+C0m} C1s={C1+C1m}
Text=+ CL1={(C1s-C0s)/3} CL2={(C0m-C1m)/3} CL3={CL2+C1m} CE={C0} Cs={C1s-CL1}
Text=+ Rs={(5*R1+R0)/6} Rm={(R0-Rs)/5}
Text=****************************************
Text=+ length=1
Text=+ cl=1
Text=+ g=1e12
Text=+ fn={fn1}
Text=+ k1={LM1/sqrt(Ls*Ls)}
Text=+ k2={LM2/sqrt(Ls*Ls)}
Text=+ k3={LM3/sqrt(Ls*Ls)}
Text=.param Rs1={Rs/2*length} Rm1={Rm/2*length}
Text=****************************************************************************************************************
Text=* left side
Text=****************************************************************************************************************
Text=G1a i1a 0 value={v(1a,1ax)-Rs1*v(i1a)-Rm1*v(i2a)-Rm1*v(i3a)-Rm1*v(i4a)-Rm1*v(i5a)-Rm1*v(i6a)}
Text=G2a i2a 0 value={v(2a,2ax)-Rm1*v(i1a)-Rs1*v(i2a)-Rm1*v(i3a)-Rm1*v(i4a)-Rm1*v(i5a)-Rm1*v(i6a)}
Text=G3a i3a 0 value={v(3a,3ax)-Rm1*v(i1a)-Rm1*v(i2a)-Rs1*v(i3a)-Rm1*v(i4a)-Rm1*v(i5a)-Rm1*v(i6a)}
Text=G4a i4a 0 value={v(4a,4ax)-Rm1*v(i1a)-Rm1*v(i2a)-Rm1*v(i3a)-Rs1*v(i4a)-Rm1*v(i5a)-Rm1*v(i6a)}
Text=G5a i5a 0 value={v(5a,5ax)-Rm1*v(i1a)-Rm1*v(i2a)-Rm1*v(i3a)-Rm1*v(i4a)-Rs1*v(i5a)-Rm1*v(i6a)}
Text=G6a i6a 0 value={v(6a,6ax)-Rm1*v(i1a)-Rm1*v(i2a)-Rm1*v(i3a)-Rm1*v(i4a)-Rm1*v(i5a)-Rs1*v(i6a)}
Text=RG1a i1a 0 1e9
Text=RG2a i2a 0 1e9
Text=RG3a i3a 0 1e9
Text=RG4a i4a 0 1e9
Text=RG5a i5a 0 1e9
Text=RG6a i6a 0 1e9
Text=Gi1a 1a 1ax value={v(i1a)}
Text=Gi2a 2a 2ax value={v(i2a)}
Text=Gi3a 3a 3ax value={v(i3a)}
Text=Gi4a 4a 4ax value={v(i4a)}
Text=Gi5a 5a 5ax value={v(i5a)}
Text=Gi6a 6a 6ax value={v(i6a)}
Text=****************************************************************************************************************
Text=* right side
Text=****************************************************************************************************************
Text=G1b i1b 0 value={v(1b,1bx)-Rs1*v(i1b)-Rm1*v(i2b)-Rm1*v(i3b)-Rm1*v(i4b)-Rm1*v(i5b)-Rm1*v(i6b)}
Text=G2b i2b 0 value={v(2b,2bx)-Rm1*v(i1b)-Rs1*v(i2b)-Rm1*v(i3b)-Rm1*v(i4b)-Rm1*v(i5b)-Rm1*v(i6b)}
Text=G3b i3b 0 value={v(3b,3bx)-Rm1*v(i1b)-Rm1*v(i2b)-Rs1*v(i3b)-Rm1*v(i4b)-Rm1*v(i5b)-Rm1*v(i6b)}
Text=G4b i4b 0 value={v(4b,4bx)-Rm1*v(i1b)-Rm1*v(i2b)-Rm1*v(i3b)-Rs1*v(i4b)-Rm1*v(i5b)-Rm1*v(i6b)}
Text=G5b i5b 0 value={v(5b,5bx)-Rm1*v(i1b)-Rm1*v(i2b)-Rm1*v(i3b)-Rm1*v(i4b)-Rs1*v(i5b)-Rm1*v(i6b)}
Text=G6b i6b 0 value={v(6b,6bx)-Rm1*v(i1b)-Rm1*v(i2b)-Rm1*v(i3b)-Rm1*v(i4b)-Rm1*v(i5b)-Rs1*v(i6b)}
Text=RG1b i1b 0 1e9
Text=RG2b i2b 0 1e9
Text=RG3b i3b 0 1e9
Text=RG4b i4b 0 1e9
Text=RG5b i5b 0 1e9
Text=RG6b i6b 0 1e9
Text=Gi1b 1b 1bx value={v(i1b)}
Text=Gi2b 2b 2bx value={v(i2b)}
Text=Gi3b 3b 3bx value={v(i3b)}
Text=Gi4b 4b 4bx value={v(i4b)}
Text=Gi5b 5b 5bx value={v(i5b)}
Text=Gi6b 6b 6bx value={v(i6b)}
Text=*******************************
Text=L1a 1ax 1ay {length*Ls/2}
Text=L2a 2ax 2ay {length*Ls/2}
Text=L3a 3ax 3ay {length*Ls/2}
Text=L4a 4ax 4ay {length*Ls/2}
Text=L5a 5ax 5ay {length*Ls/2}
Text=L6a 6ax 6ay {length*Ls/2}
Text=*******************************
Text=L1b 1ay 1bx {length*Ls/2}
